# Copy to the root of the FAT boot partition, then replace this file's contents
# with your operator public key, one key per line.
#
# Read by the headless bootstrap apkovl. Without it the bootstrap leaves root
# reachable over ssh with no password, which is not acceptable for a board on a
# deployment network. Supply the key so key authentication replaces it.
#
# Public key only. Never put a private key on a card.
ssh-ed25519 AAAA_REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_OPERATOR_PUBLIC_KEY operator@example
